{"seq":1,"slug":"profiling-tools","title":"性能剖析工具","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/system-performance/cpu-optimization/profiling-tools","wordCount":1205,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"性能剖析工具\">性能剖析工具</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>性能剖析（Profiling）是通过工具自动收集程序运行时的性能数据，找出 CPU 时间、内存分配、I/O 等待等资源消耗的具体分布。它回答了性能优化中最关键的问题：<strong>时间都花在了哪里？</strong> 剖析工具按数据采集方式分为两大类：<strong>采样型</strong>（Sampling）以固定频率中断程序并记录调用栈，开销极低（通常 &lt;5%）；<strong>插桩型</strong>（Instrumentation）在每个函数入口和出口插入计时代码，精度高但开销大（10%-100%）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    A[性能剖析] --&gt; B[采样型 Sampling]&#10;    A --&gt; C[插桩型 Instrumentation]&#10;    B --&gt; D[perf]&#10;    B --&gt; E[async-profiler]&#10;    B --&gt; F[py-spy]&#10;    C --&gt; G[gprof]&#10;    C --&gt; H[callgrind]&#10;    C --&gt; I[Go pprof]&#10;    A --&gt; J[硬件计数器]&#10;    J --&gt; K[perf stat]&#10;    J --&gt; L[Intel VTune]\">graph TB\n    A[性能剖析] --&gt; B[采样型 Sampling]\n    A --&gt; C[插桩型 Instrumentation]\n    B --&gt; D[perf]\n    B --&gt; E[async-profiler]\n    B --&gt; F[py-spy]\n    C --&gt; G[gprof]\n    C --&gt; H[callgrind]\n    C --&gt; I[Go pprof]\n    A --&gt; J[硬件计数器]\n    J --&gt; K[perf stat]\n    J --&gt; L[Intel VTune]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>代表工具</th>\n<th>开销</th>\n<th>精度</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>采样型</td>\n<td>perf, async-profiler, py-spy</td>\n<td>1-5%</td>\n<td>统计近似</td>\n<td>生产环境持续剖析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>插桩型</td>\n<td>gprof, callgrind, Go pprof</td>\n<td>10-100%</td>\n<td>精确计数</td>\n<td>开发阶段详细分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>硬件计数器</td>\n<td>perf stat, VTune, toplev</td>\n<td>&lt;1%</td>\n<td>硬件级精确</td>\n<td>CPU 微架构级优化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动态追踪</td>\n<td>BPF/bpftrace, DTrace, SystemTap</td>\n<td>按需</td>\n<td>事件级精确</td>\n<td>内核/系统调用级分析</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"perf-与火焰图\">perf 与火焰图</h2><p>Linux <code>perf</code> 是最重要的系统级性能剖析工具。它基于内核的 Performance Monitoring Unit（PMU）硬件，以极低的开销采集性能数据。<code>perf</code> 的核心工作流是：采集 → 记录 → 分析。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 对运行中的进程采样 30 秒，采样频率 99Hz（避免与系统频率共振）&#10;perf record -F 99 -p $(pgrep myapp) -g -- sleep 30&#10;&#10;# 查看热点函数排名&#10;perf report --sort=dso,symbol --stdio | head -40&#10;&#10;# 查看特定函数的逐行热点（需要编译时带 -g 调试信息）&#10;perf annotate --symbol=hot_function&#10;&#10;# 统计硬件事件&#10;perf stat -e cycles,instructions,cache-misses,branch-misses ./myapp\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 对运行中的进程采样 30 秒，采样频率 99Hz（避免与系统频率共振）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">perf</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> record</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -F</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 99</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pgrep</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> myapp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">-g</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> sleep</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 30</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 查看热点函数排名</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">perf</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> report</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --sort=dso,symbol</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --stdio</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> head</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -40</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 查看特定函数的逐行热点（需要编译时带 -g 调试信息）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">perf</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> annotate</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --symbol=hot_function</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 统计硬件事件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">perf</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> stat</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -e</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> cycles,instructions,cache-misses,branch-misses</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ./myapp</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>perf record</code> 采集的数据包含完整的调用栈信息，但原始输出难以阅读。Brendan Gregg 发明的<strong>火焰图</strong>（Flame Graph）将调用栈数据可视化为直观的堆叠图形：X 轴表示采样次数（越宽=CPU 占用越多），Y 轴表示调用深度。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 生成火焰图&#10;perf script | stackcollapse-perf.pl | flamegraph.pl &gt; flame.svg\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 生成火焰图</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">perf</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> script</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> stackcollapse-perf.pl</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> flamegraph.pl</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> flame.svg</span></span></code></pre></div><p>解读火焰图的关键技巧：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>关注宽的&quot;平台&quot;</strong>：X 轴上最宽的函数就是 CPU 热点</li>\n<li><strong>从顶部看起</strong>：火焰图顶部是实际执行的叶子函数</li>\n<li><strong>对比差分火焰图</strong>：优化前后对比可以直接看到改善效果</li>\n<li><strong>颜色无特殊含义</strong>：默认颜色只是为了区分不同的调用栈帧</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import subprocess&#10;import os&#10;&#10;def capture_flame_graph(pid: int, duration: int = 30, output: str = &quot;flame.svg&quot;):&#10;    perf_data = f&quot;/tmp/perf-{pid}.data&quot;&#10;    subprocess.run([&#10;        &quot;perf&quot;, &quot;record&quot;, &quot;-F&quot;, &quot;99&quot;,&#10;        &quot;-p&quot;, str(pid), &quot;-g&quot;,&#10;        &quot;--&quot;, &quot;sleep&quot;, str(duration)&#10;    ], check=True)&#10;&#10;    perf_script = subprocess.run(&#10;        [&quot;perf&quot;, &quot;script&quot;, &quot;-i&quot;, perf_data],&#10;        capture_output=True, text=True&#10;    )&#10;&#10;    collapse = subprocess.run(&#10;        [&quot;stackcollapse-perf.pl&quot;],&#10;        input=perf_script.stdout, capture_output=True, text=True&#10;    )&#10;&#10;    with open(output, &quot;w&quot;) as f:&#10;        subprocess.run(&#10;            [&quot;flamegraph.pl&quot;],&#10;            input=collapse.stdout, stdout=f&#10;        )\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> subprocess</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> os</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> capture_flame_graph</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(pid: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, duration: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, output: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"flame.svg\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    perf_data </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"/tmp/perf-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">pid</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.data\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    subprocess.run([</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"perf\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"record\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"-F\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"99\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"-p\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(pid), </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"-g\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"--\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sleep\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(duration)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ], </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">check</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    perf_script </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> subprocess.run(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"perf\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"script\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"-i\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, perf_data],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        capture_output</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    collapse </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> subprocess.run(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"stackcollapse-perf.pl\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        input</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">perf_script.stdout, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">capture_output</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    with</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> open</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(output, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"w\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> f:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        subprocess.run(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"flamegraph.pl\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">            input</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">collapse.stdout, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">stdout</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">f</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        )</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"语言级-profiler\">语言级 Profiler</h2><p>不同编程语言有各自的剖析工具生态，它们提供比系统级 <code>perf</code> 更丰富的语言特定信息（如 GC 时间、内存分配热点）。</p>\n<p><strong>Go pprof</strong> 是 Go 语言的内建剖析工具，支持 CPU、内存、goroutine、锁竞争等多种剖析类型：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"import (&#10;    &quot;net/http&quot;&#10;    _ &quot;net/http/pprof&quot;&#10;    &quot;runtime&quot;&#10;)&#10;&#10;func init() {&#10;    runtime.SetMutexProfileFraction(5)&#10;    runtime.SetBlockProfileRate(1)&#10;    go func() {&#10;        http.ListenAndServe(&quot;localhost:6060&quot;, nil)&#10;    }()&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 采集 CPU profile: go tool pprof http://localhost:6060/debug/pprof/profile?seconds=30&#10;// 采集 Heap profile: go tool pprof http://localhost:6060/debug/pprof/heap&#10;// 采集 Goroutine: go tool pprof http://localhost:6060/debug/pprof/goroutine\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">net/http</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    _ </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">net/http/pprof</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">runtime</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> init</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    runtime.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">SetMutexProfileFraction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    runtime.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">SetBlockProfileRate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    go</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        http.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ListenAndServe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"localhost:6060\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">nil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 采集 CPU profile: go tool pprof http://localhost:6060/debug/pprof/profile?seconds=30</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 采集 Heap profile: go tool pprof http://localhost:6060/debug/pprof/heap</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 采集 Goroutine: go tool pprof http://localhost:6060/debug/pprof/goroutine</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Node.js</strong> 的 V8 Profiler 可以生成 Chrome DevTools 可读的 cpuprofile 文件：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const inspector = require(&#39;node:inspector&#39;);&#10;const session = new inspector.Session();&#10;session.connect();&#10;&#10;session.post(&#39;Profiler.enable&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;  session.post(&#39;Profiler.start&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;    setTimeout(() =&gt; {&#10;      session.post(&#39;Profiler.stop&#39;, (err, { profile }) =&gt; {&#10;        const fs = require(&#39;node:fs&#39;);&#10;        fs.writeFileSync(&#39;profile.cpuprofile&#39;, JSON.stringify(profile));&#10;      });&#10;    }, 30000);&#10;  });&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> inspector</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> require</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'node:inspector'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> session</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> inspector.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Session</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">session.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">connect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">session.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">post</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Profiler.enable'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  session.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">post</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Profiler.start'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    setTimeout</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      session.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">post</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Profiler.stop'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">err</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">profile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> fs</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> require</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'node:fs'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        fs.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">writeFileSync</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'profile.cpuprofile'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">JSON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">stringify</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(profile));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Java</strong> 的 async-profiler 是生产级的低开销采样器，支持 CPU、内存分配和锁竞争的混合剖析：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# CPU 火焰图&#10;./profiler.sh -d 30 -f cpu.html -o flamegraph jps_pid&#10;# 内存分配火焰图&#10;./profiler.sh -d 30 -e alloc -f alloc.html jps_pid&#10;# Wall-clock 模式（包含 I/O 等待时间）&#10;./profiler.sh -d 30 -e wall -f wall.html jps_pid\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># CPU 火焰图</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">./profiler.sh</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -d</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 30</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> cpu.html</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -o</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> flamegraph</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> jps_pid</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 内存分配火焰图</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">./profiler.sh</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -d</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 30</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -e</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> alloc</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> alloc.html</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> jps_pid</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Wall-clock 模式（包含 I/O 等待时间）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">./profiler.sh</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -d</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 30</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -e</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> wall</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> wall.html</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> jps_pid</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"硬件性能计数器\">硬件性能计数器</h2><p>现代 CPU 内建了数百个硬件性能计数器（Hardware Performance Counters, HPC），可以精确统计 CPU 微架构级的事件：指令执行数、缓存命中/未命中次数、分支预测成功/失败次数、TLB 未命中次数等。这些计数器几乎零开销，是 CPU 级优化的终极数据源。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 基础统计：IPC（每周期指令数）是最重要的综合指标&#10;perf stat -e cycles,instructions,cache-references,cache-misses \\&#10;    -e branches,branch-misses,L1-dcache-load-misses \\&#10;    ./myapp&#10;&#10;# 典型输出解读:&#10;#   1,234,567,890  cycles&#10;#   2,345,678,901  instructions  # IPC = 2345/1234 = 1.90 (良好)&#10;#       5,678,901  cache-misses  # cache miss rate = 5.6M/total = 2.3% (可接受)&#10;#         123,456  branch-misses # branch miss rate = 0.1% (优秀)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 基础统计：IPC（每周期指令数）是最重要的综合指标</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">perf</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> stat</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -e</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> cycles,instructions,cache-references,cache-misses</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    -e</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> branches,branch-misses,L1-dcache-load-misses</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    ./myapp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 典型输出解读:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#   1,234,567,890  cycles</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#   2,345,678,901  instructions  # IPC = 2345/1234 = 1.90 (良好)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#       5,678,901  cache-misses  # cache miss rate = 5.6M/total = 2.3% (可接受)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#         123,456  branch-misses # branch miss rate = 0.1% (优秀)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Intel 的 <strong>Top-Down Microarchitecture Analysis (TMA)</strong> 方法将 CPU 流水线的性能损失分为四大类：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 使用 toplev 工具进行 TMA 分析&#10;toplev -l1 ./myapp&#10;# Level 1 分类:&#10;#   Frontend Bound  15.2%  ← 取指/解码阶段的停顿&#10;#   Backend Bound   45.3%  ← 执行阶段的停顿（通常是内存访问）&#10;#   Bad Speculation  8.1%  ← 分支预测失败导致的浪费&#10;#   Retiring        31.4%  ← 有效工作（越高越好）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 使用 toplev 工具进行 TMA 分析</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toplev</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -l1</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ./myapp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Level 1 分类:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#   Frontend Bound  15.2%  ← 取指/解码阶段的停顿</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#   Backend Bound   45.3%  ← 执行阶段的停顿（通常是内存访问）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#   Bad Speculation  8.1%  ← 分支预测失败导致的浪费</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#   Retiring        31.4%  ← 有效工作（越高越好）</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>TMA 分类</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>优化方向</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Frontend Bound</td>\n<td>指令供给不足</td>\n<td>优化代码布局、减小指令体积</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Backend Bound</td>\n<td>执行单元等待数据</td>\n<td>优化内存访问、提高缓存命中率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Bad Speculation</td>\n<td>错误推测的浪费</td>\n<td>优化分支预测、减少分支</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Retiring</td>\n<td>实际有效工作</td>\n<td>目标是提高此比例</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"持续剖析与生产实践\">持续剖析与生产实践</h2><p>传统的性能剖析是&quot;问题发生后采集数据&quot;的被动模式。<strong>持续剖析</strong>（Continuous Profiling）则是在生产环境中始终以低开销采集剖析数据，实现性能问题的主动发现。</p>\n<p>Google 的论文《Google-Wide Profiling》展示了他们如何在整个基础设施上进行持续剖析。开源生态中，Pyroscope、Parca 和 Grafana Pyroscope 是主流的持续剖析平台。</p>\n<p>持续剖析的典型架构：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[应用进程] --&gt;|低频采样| B[Agent]&#10;    B --&gt;|推送| C[剖析数据存储]&#10;    C --&gt; D[查询引擎]&#10;    D --&gt; E[火焰图 UI]&#10;    D --&gt; F[时间线对比]&#10;    D --&gt; G[标签过滤]&#10;    E --&gt; H[发现回归]&#10;    F --&gt; H&#10;    H --&gt; I[关联到部署/变更]\">graph LR\n    A[应用进程] --&gt;|低频采样| B[Agent]\n    B --&gt;|推送| C[剖析数据存储]\n    C --&gt; D[查询引擎]\n    D --&gt; E[火焰图 UI]\n    D --&gt; F[时间线对比]\n    D --&gt; G[标签过滤]\n    E --&gt; H[发现回归]\n    F --&gt; H\n    H --&gt; I[关联到部署/变更]</pre><p>生产环境剖析的关键实践：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>采样频率不超过 100Hz，CPU 开销控制在 1% 以内</li>\n<li>使用<strong>标签</strong>关联剖析数据与业务指标（如按版本、实例、区域过滤）</li>\n<li>建立<strong>基线</strong>并设置自动告警，当某个函数的 CPU 占比突然升高时通知相关团队</li>\n<li>结合 CI/CD 做<strong>性能回归检测</strong>：每次发布前对比新旧版本的火焰图</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((性能剖析))&#10;    采样 vs 插桩&#10;      perf 采样&#10;      gprof 插桩&#10;      选择依据&#10;    火焰图&#10;      调用栈可视化&#10;      差分对比&#10;      解读技巧&#10;    语言级工具&#10;      Go pprof&#10;      Node.js Inspector&#10;      async-profiler&#10;    硬件计数器&#10;      IPC&#10;      Cache Miss Rate&#10;      TMA 分析&#10;    持续剖析&#10;      低开销采集&#10;      基线对比&#10;      回归检测\">mindmap\n  root((性能剖析))\n    采样 vs 插桩\n      perf 采样\n      gprof 插桩\n      选择依据\n    火焰图\n      调用栈可视化\n      差分对比\n      解读技巧\n    语言级工具\n      Go pprof\n      Node.js Inspector\n      async-profiler\n    硬件计数器\n      IPC\n      Cache Miss Rate\n      TMA 分析\n    持续剖析\n      低开销采集\n      基线对比\n      回归检测</pre><ul>\n<li>性能剖析是一切优化的起点——<strong>先度量，再优化</strong>，否则就是盲目猜测</li>\n<li><strong>采样型</strong>工具（perf, async-profiler）适合生产环境，<strong>插桩型</strong>工具适合开发阶段深度分析</li>\n<li><strong>火焰图</strong>是最直观的调用栈可视化方式，关注宽平台和顶部叶子函数</li>\n<li><strong>硬件性能计数器</strong>提供 CPU 微架构级的精确数据，IPC 是最重要的综合指标</li>\n<li><strong>TMA 方法</strong>将性能损失分为四大类（Frontend/Backend/Speculation/Retiring），指导优化方向</li>\n<li><strong>持续剖析</strong>将性能分析从被动响应转为主动监控，是现代性能工程的基础设施</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"性能剖析工具","id":"性能剖析工具"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"perf 与火焰图","id":"perf-与火焰图"},{"level":2,"text":"语言级 Profiler","id":"语言级-profiler"},{"level":2,"text":"硬件性能计数器","id":"硬件性能计数器"},{"level":2,"text":"持续剖析与生产实践","id":"持续剖析与生产实践"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"阿姆达尔定律与 USL","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/system-performance/performance-fundamentals/amdahl-and-ust"},"next":{"title":"CPU 缓存优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/system-performance/cpu-optimization/cache-optimization"}}